如图为等效电路图，设降压变压器的原副线圈匝数比为 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="k:1" data-display="0">k:1</span>，则输电线上的电流为 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="I_{2}= rac{U_{2}}{R_{0}+k^{2}R}" data-display="0">I_{2}= rac{U_{2}}{R_{0}+k^{2}R}</span><br><br><div class="figures"><figure><a href="/gaokao-bank/data/images/0d8c6c4b54fe7d7ca878a136.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/gaokao-bank/data/images/0d8c6c4b54fe7d7ca878a136.jpg" alt="试题配图" loading="lazy"></a></figure></div><br><br>转子在磁场中转动时产生的电动势为 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="e = NBS\omega\sin\omega t" data-display="0">e = NBS\omega\sin\omega t</span><br><br>A．当转子角速度增加一倍时，升压变压器原副线圈两端电压都增加一倍，输电线上的电流变为 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="I_{2}&#x27; = 2I_{2}" data-display="0">I_{2}' = 2I_{2}</span>，故 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="R_{0}" data-display="0">R_{0}</span> 上消耗的电功率变为原来的 4 倍，故 A 正确；<br><br>C．升压变压器副线圈匝数增加一倍，副线圈两端电压增加一倍，输电线上的电流增加一倍，故 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="R_{0}" data-display="0">R_{0}</span> 上消耗的电功率变为原来的 4 倍，故 C 错误；<br><br>B．若 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="R_{0}" data-display="0">R_{0}</span> 阻值增加一倍，输电线路上的电流 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="I_{2}&#x27;&#x27; =  rac{U_{2}}{2R_{0} + k^{2}R}" data-display="0">I_{2}'' =  rac{U_{2}}{2R_{0} + k^{2}R}</span><br><br><span class="math-tex" data-tex="R_{0}" data-display="0">R_{0}</span> 消耗的功率 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="P_{3} = I_{2}&#x27;&#x27;^{2} \cdot 2R_{0} 
eq 4P" data-display="0">P_{3} = I_{2}''^{2} \cdot 2R_{0} 
eq 4P</span>，故 B 错误；<br><br>D．若在用户端并联一个完全相同的电阻 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="R" data-display="0">R</span>，用户端电阻减为原来的一半，输电线上的电流为 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="I_{2}&#x27;&#x27; =  rac{U_{2}}{R_{0} +  rac{k^{2}R}{2}} =  rac{2U_{2}}{2R_{0} + k^{2}R}" data-display="0">I_{2}'' =  rac{U_{2}}{R_{0} +  rac{k^{2}R}{2}} =  rac{2U_{2}}{2R_{0} + k^{2}R}</span><br><br><span class="math-tex" data-tex="R_{0}" data-display="0">R_{0}</span> 消耗的功率 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="P_{4}=I_{2}&#x27;&#x27;^{2}R_{0}
eq6P" data-display="0">P_{4}=I_{2}''^{2}R_{0}
eq6P</span>，故 D 错误。<br><br>故选 A。

